.TH "CSSMATRIXCOMPONENT.MATRIX" "3JS" "August 4, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
CSSMatrixComponent.matrix \- CSSMatrixComponent: matrix property
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]Note:\f[R] This feature is available in Web Workers.
.PP
The \f[B]\f[CB]matrix\f[B]\f[R] property of the
\f[CR]CSSMatrixComponent\f[R] interface represents a
\f[CR]DOMMatrix\f[R] object containing a 2D or 3D matrix.
.PP
See the \f[CR]matrix()\f[R] and \f[CR]matrix3d()\f[R] pages for
examples.
.SH VALUE
A \f[CR]DOMMatrix\f[R].
